Source: https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri, tag tauri-cli-v2.12.1
(crates/tauri-bundler/src/bundle/windows/nsis/installer.nsi, original SHA-256
dabed59013b1d78b879a1a85bc7f2eed2993b33a9a90cdabe5946de3d3950597), matching
the pinned @tauri-apps/cli 2.12.1. License: MIT OR Apache-2.0, upstream texts
alongside. Adapted the same way as Arcade Look's 2.12.1 template: installs to
%LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\Arcade Tools from .onInit, uses the arcade.tools Apps &
features key (upgrading from Tauri's original key), shows the shared task page
instead of the Start menu page, creates no shortcuts outside the shared tasks,
and guards Tauri's legacy cleanup with the receipt ownership result. Review it
against upstream whenever the Tauri CLI changes.

